Analysis Report: Fate/stay night Lorebook & Kara no Kyoukai Integration
Target File Analyzed: 

FATE SN RP.json
 (with cross-references to 

main_fate-masters-.json
 and 

main_type-moon-fate tsukki.json
).

1. What Nasuverse Concepts Already Exist
The existing Fate/stay night lorebook already covers a wide array of core Nasuverse mechanics and FSN-specific systems:

Universal Nasuverse Systems
The Root (Akasha / 根源の渦): Documented in 

Nasuverse_Magecraft_System
 as the ultimate source of all existence and the absolute pursuit of every Magus.
Magecraft Fundamentals:
Circuits & Energy: Magic Circuits (pseudo-nerves in the soul), Od (personal life force), Mana (environmental energy), and Prana (refined magical energy).
Mystery & Degradation: The Law of Mystery (older = stronger; mystery dilutes as modern science rationalizes phenomena) and Equivalent Exchange.
Standard Thaumaturgical Disciplines: Reinforcement (強化), Alteration (変化), Projection (投影), Jewel Magecraft, and Bounded Fields (結界).
Reality Marble (固有結界): Defined as the ultimate inner world projection that temporarily overwrites baseline reality.
The Counter Force (抑止力):
Detailed in 

Alaya_Deterrence
.
Gaia: The will of the planet to survive.
Alaya: The collective unconscious will of humanity to avoid extinction, deploying utilitarian corrections and Counter Guardians.
Runes & Ancient Spells: Referenced in the combat profiles of 

Cu Chulainn
 and 

Bazett
.
Mystic Eyes (Basics): Mentioned via 

Medusa's
 Cybele (Mystic Eyes of Petrification).
Fate / Fuyuki Specific Systems
Holy Grail War Ritual: The 60-year summoning cycle in Fuyuki, 7 Masters vs. 7 Servants, Lesser vs. Greater Grail mechanics.
The Three Absolute Rules: Concealment of Mystery, Command Spells (Makiri design, 3 uses, absolute compulsion), and Kotomine Church sanctuary.
Servant Metaphysics: Ghostly Liners (spiritual evocations anchored to Masters), Astral Form, Spiritual Core, immunity to non-magical/mundane weaponry, True Name secrecy.
Noble Phantasms & Parameters: Crystallization of legends into conceptual weapons; stat scaling from E to EX rank, including modifiers (+, ++).
Third Magic (Heaven's Feel): Materialization of the Soul, pursued by the Einzbern family.
Corrupted Grail & All the World's Evil: Angra Mainyu (Avenger), the black mud, and Servant corruption/Alteration.
Mana Transfer: Circuit synchronization through physical intimacy and bodily fluid exchange.
